adise consumed by demonic forces. Explore mystical ruins inspired by Khmer and Buddhist mythology, survive relentless arena battles, and master a unique combat system where enemy attacks become your greatest weapon.\n\nYou do not attack.\nYou deflect.", "summary": "Echoes of Above is an action game where you strike back \u2014 literally. Hit enemy projectiles mid-air, deflect their force and use the environment to survive. Master precision combat across two difficulty modes in a mythical world abandoned by the gods. Every shot fired at you is a weapon waiting to be reclaimed.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/echoes-of-above", "videos": [{"id": 188646, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "jbKnvQZ-ZG8", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jbKnvQZ-ZG8", "title": "Echoes of Above - Announce Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/jbKnvQZ-ZG8/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}